From 38dd89e5ca96410681460410b0a176af958b7bf4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 15:46:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Mod entities drawn in bones with vanilla's walk animation
 (FORK-10 5d)

An entity kind's bones are item models placed at their pivots, one
item_display each; a bone with walk swings by vanilla's limb swing
(WalkAnimationState) as the entity moves, sent as an eased transformation.
Skins can swap a bone's model.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
